PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1772762637
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                        G10/10
OL,2,V55555555CPOLICE HIT AT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CGUN LAW CLAMPDOWN
OL,4,B
OL,5, The Police Federation has hit at the
OL,6, Criminal Justice White Paper plan to
OL,7, give judges the power to pass life
OL,8, sentences on those carrying guns.
OL,10, It said it would end the differential
OL,11, between the punishment for murder and
OL,12, for carrying a firearm, so a gunman
OL,13, would not be deterred from killing.
OL,15, Laws that lay down maximum sentences
OL,16, which will not be enforced "make a
OL,17, mockery of the life sentence", it added
OL,19, But the prisoners' group NACRO said it
OL,20, was "deeply disturbed" by the move to
OL,21, allow a review of lenient sentences and
OL,22, said jail terms should be reduced.
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-96 / teletextarchive.com
